   - Edit emission_grid_build.hlsl line 102 (change 3.0 to 10.0)
   - Recompile shaders: dxc -T cs_6_6 ... for each shader

2. Apply App.cpp changes:
   - Line 3480: 10000.0f → 3000.0f
   - Line 3554: 1.0f → 15.0f
   - Line 3556: 3.0f → 8.0f
   - Rebuild C++ project

3. Run and observe:
   - Switch to Mode 9 Sub-mode 2 (Particle Relight)
   - Look for orange glow in particle clusters
   - Expect visible effect immediately

